description "Imperial Clone Commando

Left over republic commandos. Soon to be Obsolete.

^2Weaponry:
- Knuckle Plate Vibroblade (Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block, Chain Limit: 1
-- 50% extra knockback
- DC-15s Side Arm Blaster (Pistol 1)
-- 50%+ RoF, Slow Reload
- Frag Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Health Regen: 1/s to 25
- Armor Regen: 2/s to 40
- Blast Armor
- Stamina (2)
-  Dexterity (1)
- 15% Knockback Resistance
- Enhanced Teamwork (Pet Control)
- Advanced Sensors (Miraluka)
- 15% Faster Hacking

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (2) ^3[CS1]"